 "capa": "MAYDAY FROM 1987",
 "descripcion": "Eli runs the radio at an old lighthouse in Maine. At 3:07 AM, the Marguerite called for help. She sank in 1987.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you have answered?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
