   "texto": "At 3:07 AM, a boat called for help.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "It sank in 1987.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "I'm Eli, thirty-one. I run the lighthouse radio in Maine.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The last keeper left me three rules.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Answer every mayday. Keep the light turning. Never answer the Marguerite.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Tonight a storm cut the power, and the backup kicked in.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Channel sixteen crackled: Mayday, Marguerite, three souls aboard.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Out on the water, a light blinked back at me.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Three short, three long, three short. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
